{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying Cleaning</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the pressure of the water and see the thick foam cover the grime. It is designed to look and sound real, making every wash feel rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/162a609670fb14f1c0c08f80d666330c.poster.avif?t=1773103747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/162a609670fb14f1c0c08f80d666330c.webm?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/162a609670fb14f1c0c08f80d666330c.mp4?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop &amp; Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business. Open a workshop to change tires or use the customization bay to apply unique stickers to any vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/c113a8e5c27c509681da08efd5acd0c7.poster.avif?t=1773103747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/c113a8e5c27c509681da08efd5acd0c7.webm?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/c113a8e5c27c509681da08efd5acd0c7.mp4?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Card Collection System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn random vehicle cards as you work. Complete sets to unlock iconic cars and bring new customers to your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/7b07979a39442c79d2b27498514c235b.poster.avif?t=1773103747\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/7b07979a39442c79d2b27498514c235b.webm?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/7b07979a39442c79d2b27498514c235b.mp4?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Thieves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone pays. When a customer tries to run, use your tennis ball launcher to take them down with physics-based ragdoll action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/706c1c3da9a3f1fd8ed967bd97aa1a89.poster.avif?t=1773103747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/706c1c3da9a3f1fd8ed967bd97aa1a89.webm?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/706c1c3da9a3f1fd8ed967bd97aa1a89.mp4?t=1773103747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care your customers</strong>